 "strings": {
  "<Sign:1><Sign:1><Sign:1> after <Sign:2> Rush Combo.": "",
  "Double Quickstep": "",
  "Allows you to perform two Quicksteps in a row.": "",
  "Hold <Sign:4> to enter stance and press <Sign:3>\nto perform up to two Quicksteps in a row.": "",
  "Dodge Roll": "",
  "An evasive maneuver that transitions out of a Double Quickstep. Allows you to travel a sizeable distance.": "",
  "Hold <Sign:4> and press <Sign:3> again after a Double Quickstep.": "",
  "Quickstep Strike": "",
  "An attack performed from a Quickstep. Allows you to strike while dodging.": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> during a Quickstep.": "",
  "Tiger Drop": "",
  "A powerful counterattack made famous by a former yakuza legend. Allows you to stop Deadly Attack. Can be used in either combat style.": "",
  "You have not met the proper conditions.\nUse your camera to capture a 2D code somewhere in the city.": "",
  "Hold <Sign:4> to enter stance and press <Sign:1>\nright before the enemy lands a hit on you.": "",
  "Escape Counter": "",
  "Yagami performs a counterattack while shaking free of an enemy's grasp. Does not work against certain enemies.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Balance of the Tiger": "",
  "<Sign:0>/<Sign:1> while being grabbed by a weak enemy.": "",
  "Heart of a Champion": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge with every attack you block.": "",
  "Press <Sign:6>.": "",
  "Kick off of a wall and use that momentum to deliver an aerial strike.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Alters with your combat style.</color>": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_sankaku> during a Wall Jump.": "",
  "A technical move where you leapfrog over an enemy and deliver a throw or a kick.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Alters with your combat style.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> during a Leapfrog.": "",
  "Jump high up in the air and deliver an attack with the full momentum of your weight.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Alters with your combat style.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while standing on higher ground than an enemy.": "",
  "Yagami climbs onto an enemy and desperately punches the crap out of them.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Mash the correct button to deal more damage.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> near a knocked-down enemy when your health is low.": "",
  "Mercilessly kick and throw an immobilized enemy.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used during EX boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 0.5 EX Gauge segments.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Alters with your combat style.</color>": "",
  "Grab an enemy from the front and press <Sign:1>.": "",
  "Grab an enemy from the back and press <Sign:1>.": "",
  "Quickly close in on an enemy and strike their chin with the heel of your palm.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used during EX boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 0.5 EX Gauge segments.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while running near an enemy during an EX Boost.": "",
  "Deflect a flurry of oncoming attacks as you run, then blow your enemies away with the fury of your fists.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used during EX boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 0.5 EX Gauge segments.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while running near two or more enemies during an EX Boost.": "",
  "Deliver a running kick to an enemy with their back against the wall.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used during EX boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 0.5 EX Gauge segments.</color>": "",
  "While running during EX Boost, press <Sign:1> near an enemy by a wall.": "",
  "Yagami does not simply get up on his feet after taking a nasty fall. He counterattacks his way back up, letting his opponents feel the pain.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> near an enemy while knocked down.": "",
  "Get out of a bad position by counterattacking your way out of an enemy's chokehold.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while being grabbed by an enemy.": "",
  "Deftly handle and counter an enemy's enraged attack.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> againt an enemy's attack while taunting.": "",
  "Deliver a flurry of merciless kicks to a knocked-down enemy.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> near a knocked-down enemy.": "",
  "Leap into the air to match the enemy's position and kick them down to the ground.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while holding down <Sign:4> after a <symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_sankaku><symbol=button_sankaku> combo.": "",
  "Blast an enemy away with a powerful kick as they bounce up off the ground.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while holding down <Sign:4> after a <symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_sankaku><symbol=button_sankaku> combo.": "",
  "Pummel enemies while drunkenly dodging their attacks. It may seem like Yagami is leaving himself open, but this is merely a ruse.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>The move slightly alters with the number of enemies.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> near an enemy when drunkenness\nis at 6 or above.": "",
  "A continuous attack using a swing. Deliver a powerful kick that utilizes centrifugal force.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "Grab an enemy near a park swing and press <Sign:1>.": "",
  "A powerful finishing move performed at the end of a combo.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used during EX boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 0.5 EX Gauge segments.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Alters with your combat style.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> during a <Sign:1> combo while EX Boost is active.": "",
  "Finishing move that's only possible in virtual reality. Fire a ray of light that causes a large explosion.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Can only be used in Dice & Cube.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 6 EX Gauge segments.</color>": "",
  "Press <Sign:1> while holding a fighting stance.": "",
  "Focus your inner energy to release a destructive blow that drills through an enemy's chest.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Usable only during EX Boost.</color>\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses all EX Gauge segments.": "",
  "Turn the tables on your attacker by taking their trusty weapon.\n<symbol=case_file_right_arrow><color=blue>Uses 1 EX Gauge segment.</color>": "",
  "You have not met the proper conditions.\nFind the corresponding Skill Book somewhere in the city.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_sankaku> against an enemy holding a bat.": "",
  "Conscious Eater": "",
  "Take the time to think about what you're eating so as to digest properly. Eating recovers an additional 10% health.": "",
  "Healthy Eater": "",
  "Use your nutritional knowledge to get the most out of your meals. Eating recovers an additional 20% health.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Conscious Eater": "",
  "Enlightened Eater": "",
  "Eating for your chakras allows you to satisfy mind, body, and soul. Eating recovers an additional 30% health.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Healthy Eater": "",
  "Barfly": "",
  "Builds up your alcohol tolerance. Enables you to knock back brews with the best of 'em.": "",
  "Boozehound": "",
  "Builds up your alcohol tolerance even further. Enables you to down bottle after bottle without stopping.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Barfly": "",
  "Borderline Alcoholic": "",
  "Builds up your alcohol tolerance to a dangerously high level. Enables you to drink like a monster.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Boozehound": "",
  "High Roller": "",
  "Gain an extra dice roll when playing Dice & Cube.": "",
  "Elevated Roller": "",
  "Gain two extra dice rolls when playing Dice & Cube.": "",
  "You have not fulfilled the conditions. Find the corresponding Skill Book and learn High Roller.": "",
  "Exalted Roller": "",
  "Gain three extra dice rolls when playing Dice & Cube.": "",
  "You have not fulfilled the conditions. Find the corresponding Skill Book and learn Exalted Roller.": "",
  "Silent Destroyer": "",
  "When tailing, targets will be less likely to notice if you break something.": "",
  "Invisible Man": "",
  "Keeps the Caution Gauge from rising too quickly when spotted by a target you're tailing.": "",
  "Flux Fissure: Resonance": "",
  "Lengthens the window in which you can properly execute a Flux Fissure.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Flux Fissure": "",
  "Flux Fissure: Amplitude": "",
  "Greatly increases the damage of a properly executed Flux Fissure.": "",
  "Flux Fissure: Unleashed": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge when properly executing a Flux Fissure.": "",
  "Resolute Counter": "",
  "Allows you to perform a Resolute Counter when stunned by an enemy attack. Does not activate if you are sent flying. Exclusive to Tiger Style.": "",
  "<Sign:2>/<Sign:1> while recoiling from an attack.": "",
  "Dauntless Resolution": "",
  "Most enemies will be unable to stun you while performing a Resolute Counter.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Resolute Counter": "",
  "Destructive Resolution": "",
  "Enables a Resolute Counter to break through an enemy's guard.": "",
  "Knockdown Evasion": "",
  "Enables you to break your fall and recover before being completely knocked down.": "",
  "<Sign:3> while falling.": "",
  "Code Hunter": "",
  "Enhances your Map App so that it sounds an alarm whenever a 2D Code is nearby. Also indicates the position of nearby 2D Codes on the map.": "",
  "Blame Shifter": "",
  "No matter how much you wreck a store, you can keep shopping there as usual.": "",
  "Bottomless Stomach": "",
  "You can eat even when your health gauge is full.": "",
  "Friends Forever": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge when a friend meets and greets you in the city.": "",
  "Best Friends Forever": "",
  "Greatly charges up the EX Gauge when a friend meets and greets you in the city.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Friends Forever": "",
  "Beyond Best Friends Forever": "",
  "Dramatically charges up the EX Gauge when a friend meets and greets you in the city.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Best Friends Forever": "",
  "Drone Aviator": "",
  "Decreases the effect the wind has on your drone.": "",
  "You have not met the proper conditions. Continue progressing through the story.": "",
  "Drone Commander": "",
  "Greatly decreases the effect the wind has on your drone.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Drone Aviator": "",
  "Drone Ace": "",
  "Completely nullifies the effect the wind has on your drone.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Drone Commander": "",
  "Steady Hands": "",
  "Thin wires break less during a thumb turn bypass.": "",
  "Good Hands": "",
  "Thin wires break even less during a thumb turn bypass.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Steady Hands": "",
  "God Hands": "",
  "Thin wires almost never break at all during a thumb turn bypass.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Good Hands": "",
  "Esoteric Knowledge": "",
  "Increases the great success rate when creating an extract.": "",
  "Esoteric Wisdom": "",
  "Greatly increases the great success rate when creating an extract.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Esoteric Knowledge": "",
  "Esoteric Secrets": "",
  "Dramatically increases the great success rate when creating an extract.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Esoteric Wisdom": "",
  "Danger Display": "",
  "Displays enemies on the map before they discover you.": "",
  "Balance of the Tiger": "",
  "Yagami will be less likely to falter from enemy attacks while in Tiger Style.": "",
  "Elegance of the Tiger": "",
  "During EX Boost, almost any movement can be canceled out with a Quickstep. Tiger Style only.": "",
  "Ferocity of the Tiger": "",
  "Reduces the time it takes to perform a Charging Tiger attack.": "",
  "Learning requirements: Elegance of the Tiger, Charging Tiger": "",
  "Quickstep Cancel": "",
  "Allows you to cancel out of a combo by performing a Quickstep or Dodge Roll.": "",
  "Hold <Sign:4> and press <Sign:3> at a specific time during a combo.": "",
  "Flux Fissure": "",
  "Hold down <Sign:2> after a Rush Combo to gather your chi, then release <Sign:2> at the right moment to send it crashing through the enemy. Tiger Style only.": "",
  "Hold <Sign:2> / Release <Sign:2>.": "",
  "Shear Coincidence Max": "",
  "Enables you to see all shear lines when lock picking.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Shear Coincidence Lv. 2": "",
  "Liquid Courage": "",
  "Let the alcohol flowing through your veins fuel your rage. Charges up the EX Gauge faster while drunk.": "",
  "Liquid Bravery": "",
  "Let the alcohol flowing through your veins fuel your rage. Charges up the EX Gauge even faster while drunk.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Liquid Courage": "",
  "Liquid Valor": "",
  "Let the alcohol flowing through your veins fuel your rage. Charges up the EX Gauge incredibly fast while drunk.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Liquid Bravery": "",
  "Music Appreciation": "",
  "Listening to music on record player gradually replenishes health.": "",
  "Play music at the Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Key to Success": "",
  "Always know which key to use on doors you've already opened.": "",
  "Shear Coincidence Lv. 1": "",
  "Enables you to see one shear line when lock picking.": "",
  "Shear Coincidence Lv. 2": "",
  "Enables you to see three shear lines when lock picking.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Shear Coincidence Lv. 1": "",
  "Mental Momentum Lv. 1": "",
  "When tailing, gain 5 additional seconds to relocate your target.": "",
  "Mental Momentum Lv. 2": "",
  "When tailing, gain 10 additional seconds to relocate your target.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Mental Momentum Lv. 1": "",
  "Mental Momentum Max": "",
  "When tailing, gain 15 additional seconds to relocate your target.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Mental Momentum Lv. 2": "",
  "Target Locked": "",
  "When tailing, targets will emanate a faint glow that makes them easier to spot.": "",
  "Detective's Hunch": "",
  "Vibrates when the magnifying glass hovers over a hidden area during Search Mode.": "",
  "Turbo Takeoff": "",
  "Enables you to begin a drone race with an instant boost of speed.": "",
  "Accelerate at just the right time as soon as the race begins.": "",
  "Defense Systems Activate": "",
  "Enables your drone to barely hang on when its durability drops to 0. This happens only once per instance.": "",
  "Angel Investor": "",
  "Becomes easier to collect money for the Quickstarter projects you invest in.": "",
  "Photo Op Extension": "",
  "Slightly increases your photo op time during Photo Missions.": "",
  "Photo Op Sense": "",
  "Vibrates right before a photo op during Photo Missions. Also triggers a different type of vibration right before the perfect shot.": "",
  "Photo Op Pro": "",
  "Eases the requirements for successfully completing Photo Missions.": "",
  "Precision Press": "",
  "Lowers the speed of the dice roll during Dice & Cube, making it easier to stop it where you want.": "",
  "Thoughtful Gifter": "",
  "Further increases your intimacy when giving your girlfriend a present.": "",
  "Dating Whiz": "",
  "Further increases your intimacy when playing minigames with your girlfriend.": "",
  "Smooth Talker": "",
  "Further increases your intimacy when having a conversation with your girlfriend.": "",
  "Postmodern Poet": "",
  "Further increases your intimacy when exchanging text messages with your girlfriend.": "",
  "Nice Fridge": "",
  "Increases the amount of recovery items you can carry by 1.": "",
  "Sweet Fridge": "",
  "Increases the amount of recovery items you can carry by 2.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Nice Fridge": "",
  "Badass Fridge": "",
  "Increases the amount of recovery items you can carry by 3.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Sweet Fridge": "",
  "Social Smoker": "",
  "Charges up the EX Gauge when you light up a cigarette in the smoking area.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_decide> in the smoking area.": "",
  "Chain Smoker": "",
  "Greatly charges up the EX Gauge when you light up a cigarette in the smoking area.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Social Smoker": "",
  "Walking Fumigator": "",
  "Dramatically charges up the EX Gauge when you light up a cigarette in the smoking area.": "",
  "Learning requirement: Chain Smoker": "",
